		(uuid "b06a32cc-8945-4e28-b335-e4853a764eaf")
	)
	(text_box "U3 is a 24 V to 12 V LMR36510 buck powered from the isolated PLC field supply on J33/J45. D3 provides reverse protection and the complete converter loop references ISO_GND."
